# Claude Code files are local-only, never committed (owner rule)
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
claude-*/
memory/
*claude*prompt*
ORDER-SESSION-PROMPT.md

# Python
.venv/
*.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# FreeCAD
*.FCBak
*.FCStd1

# KiCad working state (route sessions, logs, per-user prefs, backups)
out/
logs/
*.kicad_prl
*-backups/
fp-info-cache
_autosave-*
~*.kicad_*
*.lck
*.dsn
*.ses

# OS noise
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Agent instruction files are local-only, never committed (the same rule as CLAUDE.md): the launcher of
# v2/docs/CODEX-WORKER.md writes one into a job's worktree and removes it after the job
AGENTS.md
# Makers' IBIS models (stream w5si, SI-001): held locally and fetched by their manifest, never committed,
# because several of their headers forbid redistribution (owner decision pending; v2/docs/EXECUTION-PLAN.md).
v2/vendor/*/ibis/*.ibs
